      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOMB OVER (1) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. Will find this more suitable and can atone. TAWNY TEARS (8) box seated early before forging to the lead turning and lifting to score (35.20) at this track in a Grade 5 NP over 600m. Can make it two on the bounce. ATTICUS (7) got the job done again after leading making it three straight at Sandown over 595m (34.61). Won at his only start from this box. Hard to fault the current string of winning form and can continue his winning ways. EDWARD NIGMA (2) can fill a top-three spot.",
